{"page":612,"width":1661,"height":2500,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"676","words":[{"text":"676","x":189,"y":140,"width":57,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 15 파일 시스템 내부구조","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":314,"y":144,"width":113,"height":26},{"text":"15","x":439,"y":144,"width":33,"height":21},{"text":"파일","x":500,"y":144,"width":39,"height":24},{"text":"시스템","x":548,"y":144,"width":60,"height":24},{"text":"내부구조","x":617,"y":145,"width":81,"height":24}]},{"text":"트 간에서 시정責!다. 클라이언트는 서버가 자료를 디스크에 기록한 것을 확인하기 전까","words":[{"text":"트","x":316,"y":269,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"간에서","x":360,"y":264,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"시정責!다.","x":460,"y":264,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"클라이언트는","x":594,"y":265,"width":173,"height":34},{"text":"서버가","x":781,"y":265,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"자료를","x":881,"y":266,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"디스크에","x":984,"y":266,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"기록한","x":1123,"y":266,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"것을","x":1234,"y":267,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"확인하기","x":1311,"y":267,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"전까","x":1458,"y":267,"width":58,"height":34}]},{"text":"지는 지연 쓰기 블록을 기용화하지 않는다. 지연 쓰기는 파일이 서로 충돌 모드로 병렬","words":[{"text":"지는","x":317,"y":321,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"지연","x":391,"y":321,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"쓰기","x":460,"y":321,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"블록을","x":530,"y":321,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"기용화하지","x":630,"y":321,"width":139,"height":36},{"text":"않는다.","x":786,"y":322,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"지연","x":897,"y":322,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"쓰기는","x":968,"y":322,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"파일이","x":1074,"y":323,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"서로","x":1186,"y":323,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"충돌","x":1264,"y":323,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"모드로","x":1344,"y":325,"width":98,"height":26},{"text":"병렬","x":1458,"y":322,"width":55,"height":35}]},{"text":"로 오픈될 때에도 A卜岳된다. 그러므로 UNIX의 의미는 유지되지 않는다(15.7.1절).","words":[{"text":"로","x":314,"y":381,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"오픈될","x":355,"y":377,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"때에도","x":456,"y":378,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"A卜岳된다.","x":553,"y":378,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"그러므로","x":685,"y":379,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"UNIX의","x":811,"y":379,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"의미는","x":941,"y":378,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"유지되지","x":1043,"y":378,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"않는다(15.7.1절).","x":1183,"y":378,"width":257,"height":37}]},{"text":"성능-을 위한 시스템의 조정은 NFS의 일관성 의미를 규정하기 어렵게 만든다. 한 기","words":[{"text":"성능-을","x":371,"y":434,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"위한","x":472,"y":434,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"시스템의","x":540,"y":434,"width":111,"height":36},{"text":"조정은","x":665,"y":436,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"NFS의","x":761,"y":435,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"일관성","x":869,"y":434,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"의미를","x":968,"y":435,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"규정하기","x":1072,"y":434,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"어렵게","x":1215,"y":434,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"만든다.","x":1326,"y":434,"width":104,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1446,"y":433,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"기","x":1489,"y":435,"width":23,"height":34}]},{"text":"계에서 생성된 새로운 파일은 다른 기계에서는 30초 동안 볼 수가 없다. 한 사이트에서","words":[{"text":"계에서","x":314,"y":490,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"생성된","x":417,"y":491,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"새로운","x":517,"y":491,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"파일은","x":614,"y":492,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":713,"y":492,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"기계에서는","x":784,"y":491,"width":146,"height":36},{"text":"30초","x":941,"y":494,"width":67,"height":28},{"text":"동안","x":1021,"y":491,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"볼","x":1098,"y":491,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"수가","x":1144,"y":491,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"없다.","x":1225,"y":490,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1313,"y":490,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"사이트에서","x":1361,"y":490,"width":152,"height":35}]},{"text":"쓴 내용이 그 파일을 읽기 위해 오픈하고 있는 다른 사이트들에 보여야 하는지의 여부","words":[{"text":"쓴","x":311,"y":547,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"내용이","x":357,"y":547,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":459,"y":553,"width":29,"height":24},{"text":"파일을","x":502,"y":548,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"읽기","x":603,"y":549,"width":51,"height":34},{"text":"위해","x":673,"y":549,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"오픈하고","x":742,"y":549,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":874,"y":548,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":947,"y":548,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"사이트들에","x":1022,"y":547,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"보여야","x":1198,"y":547,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"하는지의","x":1312,"y":547,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"여부","x":1459,"y":547,"width":58,"height":35}]},{"text":"는 결정된 바가 없다. 그 파일에 대한 새로운 오픈은 서버의 디스크에 이미 반영된 내용","words":[{"text":"는","x":310,"y":604,"width":32,"height":32},{"text":"결정된","x":355,"y":604,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"바가","x":456,"y":605,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"없다.","x":527,"y":606,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":602,"y":611,"width":29,"height":23},{"text":"파일에","x":643,"y":606,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"대한","x":741,"y":605,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"새로운","x":810,"y":606,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"오픈은","x":911,"y":605,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"서버의","x":1016,"y":605,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"디스크에","x":1124,"y":604,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"이미","x":1270,"y":604,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"반영된","x":1348,"y":604,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"내용","x":1460,"y":604,"width":58,"height":35}]},{"text":"만을 볼 수 있다. 그러므로 NFS는 UNIX 의미를 엄격히 따르지 않을 뿐만 아니라, An-","words":[{"text":"만을","x":310,"y":660,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"볼","x":381,"y":662,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":422,"y":663,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":465,"y":662,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"그러므로","x":540,"y":663,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"NFS는","x":665,"y":664,"width":94,"height":32},{"text":"UNIX","x":