목적에서 일반까지 다양한 파일 시스템 유형을 제공한다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":325,"y":1010,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"범용","x":363,"y":1000,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제는","x":430,"y":1001,"width":146,"height":34},{"text":"특수","x":585,"y":1001,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"목적에서","x":653,"y":1000,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"일반까지","x":783,"y":1000,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"다양한","x":913,"y":1000,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":1015,"y":1000,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"시스템","x":1091,"y":999,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"유형을","x":1200,"y":999,"width":101,"height":33},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1313,"y":999,"width":139,"height":33}]},{"text":"• 파일 시스템이 포함된 볼륨은 컴퓨터의 파일 시스템 공간에 마운트 될 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":324,"y":1077,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"파일","x":359,"y":1067,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"시스템이","x":429,"y":1067,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"포함된","x":554,"y":1067,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"볼륨은","x":650,"y":1067,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터의","x":752,"y":1066,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":880,"y":1067,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"시스템","x":952,"y":1066,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"공간에","x":1057,"y":1065,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"마운트","x":1166,"y":1065,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"될","x":1280,"y":1065,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":1323,"y":1065,"width":35,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":1372,"y":1065,"width":69,"height":33}]},{"text":"• 운영체제에 따라 파일 시스템 공간은 결합된 표시 없이 매끄럽거나(디렉터리 구조에","words":[{"text":"•","x":321,"y":1144,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"운영체제에","x":356,"y":1133,"width":145,"height":35},{"text":"따라","x":514,"y":1133,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":582,"y":1133,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"시스템","x":651,"y":1132,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"공간은","x":748,"y":1132,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"결합된","x":850,"y":1132,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"표시","x":951,"y":1132,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"없이","x":1028,"y":1131,"width":58,"height":34},{"