":1117,"y":1486,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"파티션을","x":1230,"y":1484,"width":135,"height":36},{"text":"선택할","x":1380,"y":1483,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1488,"y":1483,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"있다.","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":353,"y":1547,"width":62,"height":34}]},{"text":"• 시스템의 대부분은 다중 사용자 시스템이므로 파일 공유 및 파일 보호 방법을 제공","words":[{"text":"•","x":315,"y":1626,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"시스템의","x":352,"y":1614,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"대부분은","x":480,"y":1614,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"다중","x":608,"y":1613,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"사용자","x":677,"y":1611,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"시스템이므로","x":781,"y":1612,"width":184,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":979,"y":1613,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"공유","x":1056,"y":1614,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"및","x":1139,"y":1613,"width":28,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":1183,"y":1611,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"보호","x":1264,"y":1611,"width":67,"height":28},{"text":"방법을","x":1346,"y":1608,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"제공","x":1458,"y":1608,"width":60,"height":34}]},{"text":"해야 한다. 파일과 디렉터리에는 종종 소유자, 사용자 및 그룹 액세스 권한과 같은","words":[{"text":"해야","x":352,"y":1673,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":422,"y":1672,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"파일과","x":501,"y":1672,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"디렉터리에는","x":602,"y":1670,"width":177,"height":35},{"text":"종종","x":792,"y":1671,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"소유자,","x":867,"y":1670,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"사용자","x":985,"y":1671,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"및","x":1099,"y":1671,"width":28,"height":33},{"text":"그룹","x":1145,"y":1671,"width":67,"height":32},{"text":"액세스","x":1229,"y":1668,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"권한과","x":1345,"y":1666,"width":98,"height":33},{"text":"같은","x":1457,"y":1665,"width":62,"height":34}]},{"text":"메타데이터가 포함된다.","words":[{"text":"메타데이터가","x":352,"y":1730,"width":173,"height":35},{"text":"포함된다.","x":535,"y":1729,"width":121,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 대용량 저장장치 파티션은 raw 블록 I/O 또는 파